{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0b09ec339c036c285258202c4234987d.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0b09ec339c036c285258202c4234987d.webm?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0b09ec339c036c285258202c4234987d.mp4?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Prison Island, the world\u2019s most adorably dysfunctional high-security facility, where overworked robot wardens struggle to contain mischievous animal inmates who will do anything to escape, no matter how absurd the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a chaotic 4v2 asymmetrical party game where four animal players team up to sabotage the prison, complete messy objectives, and slip past the escape gates. Two robot players work together to hunt them down, capture them, and send them to the Nap Room for a quick timeout before the escape continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on Prison Island, escapes are never clean. Animals use potty powers as unexpected tools that bring chaos and comedy to every attempt. From there, each escape becomes a ridiculous clash between mischievous animals and overworked robots struggling to keep the prison from falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/bf3be75d3f36b9db05467a8fea99fedc.avif?t=1768240988\" width=920 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become one of Prison Island\u2019s misguided (but lovable) high-risk residents, each with bizarre backstories and a stomach\u2013bladder combo that can\u2019t sit still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/cb22d1b63f0b94d3f8a773282f546860.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/cb22d1b63f0b94d3f8a773282f546860.webm?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/cb22d1b63f0b94d3f8a773282f546860.mp4?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Work Together to Escape</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Team up or queue solo to complete ridiculous objectives, coordinate outrageous escape plans, and unleash a mix of clever strategies and chaotic bodily functions. Stay alert because a single mistake can send you straight to the Nap Room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/8c6273f79daa8fcbb335883c3b311825.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/8c6273f79daa8fcbb335883c3b311825.webm?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/8c6273f79daa8fcbb335883c3b311825.mp4?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Select Your Animal Inmate</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every animal offers a distinct skillset and personality. Whether you're carving through robots as a lion sword master, tricking pursuers as an elephant art-fraudster, or creating pure pandemonium with your messy abilities, every match offers new chaos and unique breakouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/131adcedc73de2ee3efb1ca3e13476e4.avif?t=1768240988\" width=920 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grab a partner and hunt down the escaping inmates using customizable robot parts, powerful gadgets, and circuitry tough enough to withstand constant exposure to\u2026unexpected liquids.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0291e8b3b9c554d5d830646885a7d4f0.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0291e8b3b9c554d5d830646885a7d4f0.webm?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0291e8b3b9c554d5d830646885a7d4f0.mp4?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Mix &amp; Match Robot Parts</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your robot from interchangeable parts, combining upper and lower bodies to capture animals your own way. Shape your offense with options like the Stun Gun for shocking close-range captures or the Lasso for long-distance takedowns. Adapt your movement with options like the Wheels for high-speed chases or Tank Treads for bulldozing through obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/2abab81e67607efa4181a322e7716e08.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/2abab81e67607efa4181a322e7716e08.webm?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/2abab81e67607efa4181a322e7716e08.mp4?t=1768240988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Choose Your Gadget &amp; Boost</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip your robot with active-use gadgets and passive boosts that shape your capture strategy. Use gadgets like the Magic Hand to set traps or the Wormhole to slip through walls, then pair them with boosts like Shield for protection or Camouflage to vanish when standing still. Collect Poopie during each match to unlock powerful upgrades and supercharge your robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/8728fd7f55cd67036a2ddbd435a1ab0f.avif?t=1768240988\" width=920 height=139 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute looks, total chaos! Enjoy<strong> fast-paced, asymmetrical 4v2 battles</strong> between the Animals Team and the Robot Team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick <strong>10-minute matches</strong> make it perfect for parties and pick-up-and-play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious yet surprisingly strategic battle system built around <strong>mess-based mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable art by <strong>Kanahei </strong>paired with a high-energy soundtrack from<strong> TeddyLoid</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full cross-play support </strong>across all platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S<strong>ingle-player campaign </strong>that uncovers the strange secrets of Prison Island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to earn <strong>Pritto Coins</strong> and unlock fun customization items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize both animals and robots with <strong>unique skins and decorations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends using custom rules in <strong>Private Match</strong> mode</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/739c91c65969b2359270f9aa9821bfbbed7d8bd9.jpg"},{"name":"Pritto Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/869c59679fdcfd6b6336ebb78df3a4fe27099cf9.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/5374e5b0ea0caaa16b96d7d4da19ee66db5ddda2.jpg"},{"name":"Prison Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/bd7e05514bafb255647b8291251fb9398856efed.jpg"},{"name":"Robot Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/8a623edca38e4810a3b55804f4af8a9d376fbb56.jpg"},{"name":"The World Is Poopie-Colored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/e34657948c20c770c8b58f7861b3bb536fdc0b03.jpg"},{"name":"God Escaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/3b33023201ba7cae1b059342ced84204cd3116cd.jpg"},{"name":"Philanthropist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/45a499250080188d06c319402361b7da791343b4.jpg"},{"name":"Cold-Blooded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/ef9f3b7018ee6c89b547051635266a2996efa6f4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3036800/f98059945e8ad6f284ba24ce8bd6c600c3a72b83.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3036800?t=1768240988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3036800?t=1768240988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/fbd1602e5fbc94674c1e106a432e888d27edb538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768240988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/fbd1602e5fbc94674c1e106a432e888d27edb538/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768240988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4018230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/extras/0b09ec339c036c285258202c4234987d.poster.avif?t=1768240988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams